type: software
title: "r2lambda: Deploy R Scripts as AWS Lambda Functions"
abstract: >-
  Build, test and deploy R scripts as 'AWS Lambda' functions packaged in
  'Docker' container images. Wraps functionality from the 'paws' and
  'lambdr' packages.
